    "horizontalBasis": "Exact-QID current51-vertex whole; no separate component controls. Paired front corners at+X oppose rounded-X rear apse.",
    "architecturalHeights": "Retained exact-QID OSM way502489243/Q2465016 matches current main35184874578075. All51 current whole-outline vertices and raw tags reproduce by rigid rotation without rescale. Earlier multilingual tags, white plaster/green metal roof and building:levels1 remain retained. Current PMTiles emits height5m, conflicting with the pictured multi-tier cathedral; original OSM control and retained facts provide no measured height, so5m remains cartographic metadata and every modeled height is a picture estimate. Native+X paired tower front contrasts with-X rounded rear apse. Internal Boolean clips and side circular partitions, nave wall23m/roof29m, front wall25m/shaped central gable36m/cross38.8m, twin tower lower25m/open lower belfry25.8..35m/open upper36..44m/round attic44..47m/green caps49m/cross55m, round side chapels17m/green roofs20m/lanterns23m/cross25m, rear apse23m/green roof24.2m/lantern28m/cross30.5m and low ranges11m/12.5m are estimated. Exact ornament, fenestration, hidden roof joins, measured heights and engineering accuracy are unverified."
